WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.416
Welcome to Lee's Detective Agency.

00:00:02.416 --> 00:00:04.000
We accept every manner of requests

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:05.125
and will do our best to meet your needs

00:00:05.125 --> 00:00:06.125
in goods delivery, pickup,

00:00:06.125 --> 00:00:07.375
infiltration, investigation,

00:00:07.375 --> 00:00:08.625
arbitration, and conflict resolution.

00:00:08.625 --> 00:00:10.500
We strive to serve you better.

00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:13.750
We can solve *anything* in Lungmen.

00:00:13.750 --> 00:00:14.541
And certainly,

00:00:14.541 --> 00:00:16.416
except for detective work

00:00:16.416 --> 00:00:18.416
because that's police business...

00:00:18.416 --> 00:00:21.375
Please don't expect this to be a detective show.

00:00:46.500 --> 00:00:50.166
Illuminating street lamps.

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:55.000
Lit up the city.

00:00:57.625 --> 00:01:01.041
Criss-crossing neons,

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:05.541
and I begin to see.

00:01:07.041 --> 00:01:10.875
The day just ended for someone.

00:01:12.500 --> 00:01:16.791
And the day just started for somebody.

00:01:17.750 --> 00:01:21.791
In empty streets I walked about

00:01:23.000 --> 00:01:27.041
Confessing my boredom out loud.

00:01:28.250 --> 00:01:30.000
I wanna keep feeling it

00:01:30.125 --> 00:01:33.625
But you won't forget about this

00:01:34.916 --> 00:01:38.416
Knock Three Times, before requesting.

00:01:39.041 --> 00:01:40.625
I wanna keep touching it

00:01:40.875 --> 00:01:44.625
Trouble's no longer a thing

00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:47.000
When a future

00:01:47.375 --> 00:01:50.375
You just waved to me.

00:02:02.750 --> 00:02:07.125
A Night of Rain

00:03:10.166 --> 00:03:11.666
Aak, see who's knocking at the door.

00:03:16.541 --> 00:03:19.250
Waai Fu, did you forget your keys again?

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:31.625
Lee's Detective Agency.

00:03:32.041 --> 00:03:33.250
What do you need?

00:03:52.000 --> 00:03:54.625
Buy more fruits
Laundry: Waai Fu
Dishes: Hung
Groceries: Hung
Car washing: Hung
Do it yourself!!!

00:04:20.375 --> 00:04:21.250
It's been a while.

00:04:23.125 --> 00:04:23.500
Meng,

00:04:24.125 --> 00:04:25.375
why are you here?

00:04:26.125 --> 00:04:27.750
It's a long story.

00:04:30.416 --> 00:04:31.750
After you left,

00:04:34.875 --> 00:04:36.000
I've been through a few things

00:04:38.541 --> 00:04:40.291
and left Yan.

00:04:42.916 --> 00:04:43.375
What

00:04:44.250 --> 00:04:45.125
happened to you?

00:04:46.375 --> 00:04:47.875
Nothing important.

00:04:50.291 --> 00:04:53.375
I heard you're working for some agency now,

00:04:53.625 --> 00:04:54.500
so I came here for a visit.

00:04:54.666 --> 00:04:55.625
Who told you that?

00:04:58.916 --> 00:05:00.375
That's not important.

00:05:01.125 --> 00:05:02.750
I'm just glad to see you again.

00:05:02.750 --> 00:05:03.625
That's enough.

00:05:04.375 --> 00:05:06.000
This friend of yours is sick.

00:05:06.250 --> 00:05:08.416
You're aware of that, right?

00:05:08.416 --> 00:05:09.125
You're sick?

00:05:11.375 --> 00:05:12.250
You have oripa...

00:05:12.250 --> 00:05:14.000
Just a common cold.

00:05:19.916 --> 00:05:22.250
Why don't we have any cold meds in the agency office?

00:05:22.916 --> 00:05:25.500
I came down with a bad cold a while ago and ate them all.

00:05:25.791 --> 00:05:26.375
I'll go and buy some.

00:05:26.500 --> 00:05:27.250
Wait for me.

00:05:34.416 --> 00:05:35.500
This is delicious.

00:05:36.125 --> 00:05:37.416
I miss these flavors.

00:05:39.916 --> 00:05:42.291
This should alleviate your symptoms.

00:05:45.791 --> 00:05:46.375
Thank you.

00:05:47.000 --> 00:05:48.291
But I can't stay.

00:05:49.625 --> 00:05:51.666
Can I take these to go?

00:05:53.041 --> 00:05:55.375
The packaging will cost a LMD.

00:06:17.625 --> 00:06:19.666
Number 2 is still in the hospital.

00:06:21.041 --> 00:06:22.041
Did Meng do this?

00:06:22.541 --> 00:06:22.916
Meng,

00:06:22.916 --> 00:06:25.916
That girl came and thrashed us for no reason.

00:06:26.875 --> 00:06:29.375
Then she asked us where Lee's Detective Agency is.

00:06:29.500 --> 00:06:32.250
Get me back up on my feet! I can still fight!

00:06:34.291 --> 00:06:36.041
If I see you next time.

00:06:36.125 --> 00:06:37.875
I'll definitely have you all arrested.

00:06:38.125 --> 00:06:41.000
Real estate target: Achieve monthly KPIs
Deal: Listen to da Boss!!
Get the meds

00:06:42.458 --> 00:06:45.041
(Lungmen News Express, bringing you the latest reports:)

00:06:45.625 --> 00:06:48.916
(Lungmen recently launched a series of traditional cultural events)

00:06:49.166 --> 00:06:53.625
(with calligraphy and painting competitions, attracting quite a crowd.)
Ugh, can you keep it down?

00:06:54.041 --> 00:06:55.750
(I love this event!)

00:06:56.333 --> 00:06:57.416
(Look at this flower!)

00:06:57.833 --> 00:06:58.791
(It's so pretty,)

00:06:59.333 --> 00:07:00.333
(like me!)
Where's Meng?

00:07:01.250 --> 00:07:02.000
WHAT?!

00:07:02.875 --> 00:07:05.500
A cold front has hit Lungmen hard

00:07:05.666 --> 00:07:07.750
and threatens the livelihood of many homeless individuals.

00:07:08.000 --> 00:07:10.375
Some have already gone missing.

00:07:10.750 --> 00:07:16.041
Authorities have stepped up efforts to keep
medical services running and available to those in need.

00:07:16.291 --> 00:07:20.041
Emergency medical equipment and personnel
have been placed under a state of urgency.

00:07:31.500 --> 00:07:34.416
She's an Infected and won't be around for long.

00:07:35.000 --> 00:07:36.916
She asked me to give you this.

00:07:40.791 --> 00:07:41.250
Hung.

00:07:42.000 --> 00:07:42.875
It's been a while.

00:07:44.125 --> 00:07:45.416
I returned to Lungmen

00:07:45.916 --> 00:07:48.625
just to have another bite of your cooking.

00:08:41.000 --> 00:08:42.750
Should we have some fish today?

00:08:42.875 --> 00:08:45.250
HEY! You can't eat goldfish!

00:08:59.750 --> 00:09:03.916
I took this hat when I escaped,

00:09:04.625 --> 00:09:06.500
because you'll look silly with this on your head.

00:09:08.000 --> 00:09:09.875
But you probably won't want it.

00:09:14.125 --> 00:09:14.625
Let's go!

00:09:15.416 --> 00:09:16.750
I'm making dinner!

00:09:17.041 --> 00:09:17.541
Awesome!

00:09:54.958 --> 00:09:58.708
(Handwritten) The requestor wanted some of Hung's cooking for takeaway 

00:09:58.708 --> 00:10:01.458
but I couldn't find a takeaway box.

00:10:01.458 --> 00:10:09.958
I took a bowl from the cupboard and charged her 1 LMD for the packaging.

00:10:11.958 --> 00:10:14.916
To be continued...

